# futo-departments

Faculties and departments data for [FUTO](https://futo.edu.ng) (Federal University of Technology Owerri), with helper utilities.

This is the Rust port of the [`@idikaeliada/futo-departments`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@idikaeliada/futo-departments) JavaScript package.

## Installation

```toml
[dependencies]
futo-departments = "1.0"
```

## Usage

```rust
use futo_departments::{
    FACULTIES, DEPARTMENTS,
    get_faculty, get_faculty_by_department, get_departments_by_faculty,
    shorten_department, expand_department,
    shorten_faculty, expand_faculty,
    is_valid_department, is_valid_faculty,
    mask_reg_number,
};

// Static data
println!("{} faculties", FACULTIES.len());   // 12
println!("{} departments", DEPARTMENTS.len()); // 60

// Lookups (all case-insensitive)
let faculty = get_faculty("School of Science").unwrap();
println!("{}", faculty.abbreviation); // SCOS

let abbr = shorten_department("Computer Science").unwrap();
println!("{}", abbr); // CSC

let full = expand_department("CYB").unwrap();
println!("{}", full); // Cyber Security

let school = get_faculty_by_department("Computer Science").unwrap();
println!("{}", school); // School of Science

let depts = get_departments_by_faculty("School of Science");
println!("{} departments", depts.len()); // 7

// Validation
assert!(is_valid_department("Computer Science"));
assert!(is_valid_faculty("School of Science"));

// Masking
let masked = mask_reg_number("U2020/1234567CS");
println!("{}", masked); // U***7CS
```

## Available data

| Field | Count |
|---|---|
| Faculties | 12 |
| Departments | 60 |

